'''Giratina and the Sky Warrior''' is a graphic novel published by [[VIZ Media]] in North America and [[Shogakukan]] in Japan. It is a manga-style book (branded as "Ani-Manga" by VIZ) which retells the plot of ''[[M11|Giratina and the Sky Warrior]]'' using screenshots from the film. [[Hideki Sonoda]] is credited as the author.

